# СКОПИРУЙТЕ/ДОБАВЬТЕ ЗНАЧЕНИЯ В СВОЙ backend/.env. НЕ ОТПРАВЛЯЙТЕ .env В ЧАТ И GIT.
DJANGO_SECRET_KEY=PASTE_GENERATED_RANDOM_KEY_HERE
DJANGO_DEBUG=True
DJANGO_ALLOWED_HOSTS=localhost,127.0.0.1
DB_NAME=lms_db
DB_USER=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=YOUR_OWN_POSTGRES_PASSWORD
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432

# Optional private S3-compatible media storage. Keep local until a bucket exists.
MEDIA_STORAGE_MODE=local
MEDIA_S3_BUCKET=
MEDIA_S3_REGION=us-east-1
MEDIA_S3_ENDPOINT=
MEDIA_S3_ACCESS_KEY=
MEDIA_S3_SECRET_KEY=
MEDIA_S3_ADDRESSING_STYLE=auto

# Password recovery: local previews by default; no email leaves this computer.
# For actual delivery, set the SMTP backend and your provider's settings.
# EMAIL_BACKEND=django.core.mail.backends.smtp.EmailBackend
# EMAIL_HOST=smtp.your-provider.example
# EMAIL_PORT=587
# EMAIL_USE_TLS=True
# EMAIL_USE_SSL=False
# EMAIL_HOST_USER=
# EMAIL_HOST_PASSWORD=
# EMAIL_TIMEOUT=30
# DEFAULT_FROM_EMAIL=BTBS <no-reply@your-domain.example>
# PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://your-platform.example

# Local encrypted backups. The encryption key must be copied separately and kept private.
# LMS_BACKUP_DIR=C:/BTBS-backups
# LMS_BACKUP_KEY_FILE=C:/BTBS-private/backup.key
LMS_BACKUP_KEEP=7
# LMS_PG_BIN=C:/Program Files/PostgreSQL/18/bin
